        "if": "contingent.is(subfaction:blackshields) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-dark-angels) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-emperors-children) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-iron-warriors) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-white-scars) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-space-wolves) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-imperial-fists) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-night-lords) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-blood-angels) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-iron-hands) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-world-eaters) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-ultramarines) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-death-guard) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-thousand-sons) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-sons-of-horus) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-salamanders) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-raven-guard) and not contingent.is(subfaction:oath-of-moment-panoply-of-old-alpha-legion)",
        "message": "Blackshields Detachments only; one Panoply of Old per Detachment"
    },
